@startuml
title SD07 - Generate and Review Flashcards
actor Student
participant FlashcardController as UI
participant FlashcardService as Cards
participant MaterialSearchService as Search
participant PromptBuilder as Prompts
participant LlmClient as LLM
participant StructuredResponseParser as Parser
participant FlashcardRepository as CardRepo
participant FlashcardAttemptRepository as ReviewRepo
Student -> UI: generateFlashcards(course, topic)
UI -> Cards: generateFlashcards(request)
Cards -> Search: search(courseId, topic, topK)
Search --> Cards: source chunks
Cards -> Prompts: groundedPrompt(chunks, flashcard task)
Cards -> LLM: generate(request)
LLM --> Cards: structured response
Cards -> Parser: parseFlashcards(response)
Cards -> CardRepo: saveAll(cards)
Cards --> UI: flashcards with sources
Student -> UI: review(cardId, rating)
UI -> Cards: recordReview(request)
Cards -> ReviewRepo: save(attempt)
Cards --> UI: review recorded
@enduml
